code ("svn export svn://
svn.r-forge.r-project.org/svnroot/genabel/tutorials/GenABEL_general"), make
the corrections (e.g. there are many typos and awkward phrasings) to the
tutorial, and submit the patches to <a href="
https://r-forge.r-project.org/mail/?group_id=505">the genabel-developers'
mailing list</a>.

Note that not all the data used in "closed" version were transferrable to
the open version. These parts are indicated with "DATAPROBLEM" in the text.
We will appreciate your help in fixing this problems.

